WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
One system, from job ad to monthly retro.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
Runs weekly on a schedule. Same five gates every run.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.500
Gates first, then experience. See where the pipeline leaks.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.700
Every run re-reads its sources. It checks assumptions before any decision.

5
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:22.700
The system recommends Pursue, Reserve, or Fail. A human makes every call.

6
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:28.000
Personas built on hiring data show what each hiring manager needs.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.400
Each month, findings become experiments and INVEST user stories. A human approves before anything is saved.

8
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:39.400
Cowork schedules the runs, Projects hold the rules, and ClickUp tracks the work.

9
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:44.400
Built in Claude Cowork and ClickUp, based on PMI's Practical AI for Agile Workflows.
